        "original_id": "dfa53539-96ba-5ff8-930b-44bacb46f25c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Seed of Chucky, Child's Play 3, Curse of Chucky, The Wind in the Willows\n- Franchises: Child's Play\n- People: Keith-Lee Castle\n\nFacts:\n- Child's Play 3 is a 1991 American supernatural slasher film.\n- Keith-Lee Castle played Clarence Weasel in The Wind in the Willows in 1996.\n- Seed of Chucky is a 2004 American supernatural comedy slasher film.\n- Seed of Chucky is the fifth installment of the Child's Play series and a sequel to 1998's Bride of Chucky.\n- Keith-Lee Castle appeared in Seed of Chucky in 2004 as the owner of the doll, described as \"the psychotic Psychs.\"\n- Curse of Chucky is a 2013 American supernatural slasher film.\n- Curse of Chucky is the sixth installment of the Child's Play franchise.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
